# RL Algorithm Reference Guide

## Purpose
Provides reference materials from OpenAI's "Spinning Up in Deep RL" for:
- Understanding RL fundamentals and MDPs
- Model-free algorithm taxonomy
- Policy gradient derivations
- Six reference algorithms (VPG, TRPO, PPO, DDPG, TD3, SAC)
- Debugging RL code
- Running multi-seed experiments

## When to Apply
- Implementing or modifying RL algorithms
- Debugging RL training instability
- Selecting appropriate algorithms for tasks
- Designing reward functions
- Setting hyperparameters for RL training

## Reference Materials
- Policy gradient methods and derivations
- Algorithm comparison guidelines
- Common debugging strategies for RL
- Experimental design principles
